# Environment Variables
#
# Metrx is a fully client-side application.
# All processing (DuckDB SQL, WebLLM inference) runs directly in the browser.
#
# No environment variables are required to run this project.
# This file exists for reference purposes only.
#
# If you add server-side features in the future, document their variables here.
# Example format:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SOME_KEY=your_value_here
# SOME_SECRET=your_secret_here
